educate you a little bit

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:30.823
more about karate.

00:00:30.823 --> 00:00:32.540
If you're so into the
show, you should know

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.620
that karate began as a
common fighting system

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:39.000
known as Te and after trade
relationships were established

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.800
with the Ming Dynasty of
China in 1372, by King Satto,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.200
some forms of Chinese
martial arts were introduced

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.780
to the Ryukyu Islands by
the visitors from China,

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.020
particularly Fujian Chinese families

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.125
who moved to Okinawa around 1392

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:58.200
(voice fades out)
(dream sequence music)

